v0.1.1 (05-OCT-26)
------------------
- Added the "audiowedge" daemon to maintain a constant presence on the audio
  hardware. This prevents pops and delays when playing audio and ensures the
  stream being sent to the hardware isn't out of bounds in relation to its
  capabilities.
- Modified "dotctl" to work with the audiowedge daemon.
- Added file-5.47-r2
- Added openssl-sftp-server-10.3p1-r1
- Bumped libcrypto to 3.5.9-r0
- Bumped libssl3 to 3.5.9-r0
- Bumped libexpat to 2.8.5-r0
- Bumped libpcre2 to 10.49-r0


v0.1 (04-OCT-26)
----------------
Initial release. Pre-1.0 version number as this is a brand new experiment and the
full feature set for the OS has definitely not been hammered out just yet. Some
basic stuff still needs to be added and several issues have been discovered
during use that need to be fixed.
